# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Lifelines is the site's front page: "/" serves
# the Lifelines app (a 200 proxy, so the address bar keeps "/" and any query
# such as ?admin). The target is the clean URL because Pages itself redirects
# *.html to it, and proxying to a redirect is fragile.
#
# serve.json mirrors this rule for the local test server (npx serve, which
# rejects comments in its config, so the explanation lives here); a unit test
# (tests/unit/site-routing.test.js) keeps the two in agreement.
/  /apps/church-history-2  200
